1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
It was the last game of his career…

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,700
…a World Cup final.

3
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:06,850
And Zinedine Zidane walked off with a red card.

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,500
July 9, 2006. Berlin.

5
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:11,450
France against Italy.

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,500
7 minutes in, Zidane takes a penalty… and chips it.

7
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:19,350
It hits the crossbar… bounces down… over the line.

8
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:23,400
12 minutes later, Marco Materazzi heads Italy level.

9
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:25,800
1–1. Extra time.

10
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:28,600
Zidane and Materazzi exchange words.

11
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:33,850
Zidane walks away… then turns around… and headbutts him in the chest.

12
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:37,050
The referee didn’t see it. The fourth official did.

13
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:42,550
Red card. Zidane walks past the World Cup trophy… and off the pitch, forever.

14
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:44,950
Italy won on penalties.

15
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,850
And Zidane was still voted the best player of the tournament.

16
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:50,550
Materazzi later said he insulted Zidane’s sister.

17
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:53,500
Zidane never repeated the words.

18
00:00:53,550 --> 00:00:55,300
Would you have sent him off?

19
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:56,700
Tell me in the comments.
